<template><view class="page"><view class="bar"><text @tap="back">‹</text><text>{{ noteId ? '编辑空间文章' : '新建空间文章' }}</text><text @tap="save">保存</text></view><scroll-view class="scroll" scroll-y><view class="content"><input v-model="form.title" class="input title" placeholder="文章标题" /><textarea v-model="form.content" class="textarea" auto-height maxlength="30000" placeholder="记录此刻的想法…" /><ImageUploadGrid v-model="images" @change="syncImages" /><view class="publish-row"><text>对空间成员可见</text><switch :checked="form.is_published" color="#1d6347" @change="form.is_published = $event.detail.value" /></view><button class="primary" :loading="saving" @tap="save">{{ noteId ? '保存修改' : '发布到空间' }}</button></view></scroll-view></view></template>
<script>
import { createSpaceNote, getSpaceNote, updateSpaceNote } from '../../services/api'
import ImageUploadGrid from '../../components/ImageUploadGrid.vue'
export default { components:{ImageUploadGrid}, data(){return{spaceId:'',noteId:'',form:{title:'',content:'',cover_url:'',is_published:true},images:[],saving:false}}, onLoad(q){this.spaceId=q.spaceId||'';this.noteId=q.noteId||'';if(this.noteId)this.load()}, methods:{async load(){try{const n=await getSpaceNote(this.spaceId,this.noteId);this.form={title:n.title||'',content:n.content||'',cover_url:n.cover_url||'',is_published:n.is_published!==false};if(n.cover_url)this.images=[{id:'cover',url:n.cover_url,localPath:n.cover_url,status:'success',progress:100}]}catch(e){uni.showToast({title:'文章读取失败',icon:'none'})}},syncImages(items){const first=items.find(i=>i.status==='success'&&i.url);this.form.cover_url=first?first.url:''},async save(){if(this.saving)return;if(!this.form.title.trim()){uni.showToast({title:'请填写标题',icon:'none'});return}this.saving=true;try{const payload={...this.form,title:this.form.title.trim(),content:this.form.content.trim()};if(this.noteId)await updateSpaceNote(this.spaceId,this.noteId,payload);else await createSpaceNote(this.spaceId,payload);uni.showToast({title:'已保存',icon:'success'});setTimeout(()=>uni.navigateBack({delta:1}),500)}catch(e){uni.showToast({title:'保存失败，请检查空间权限',icon:'none'})}finally{this.saving=false}},back(){uni.navigateBack({delta:1})}}}
</script>
<style scoped>.page{height:100vh;background:#f1eee5}.bar{height:calc(var(--status-bar-height) + 104rpx);padding:var(--status-bar-height) 28rpx 0;box-sizing:border-box;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;background:#fffdf8;color:#17211d;font-size:26rpx;font-family:Georgia,'Songti SC',serif;font-weight:700}.bar text:first-child{font-size:56rpx;line-height:50rpx}.bar text:last-child{color:#1d6347;font-family:inherit;font-size:22rpx}.scroll{height:calc(100vh - var(--status-bar-height) - 104rpx)}.content{padding:28rpx}.input,.textarea{width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;border-radius:24rpx;background:#fffdf8;color:#17211d}.input{height:88rpx;padding:0 22rpx;font-family:Georgia,'Songti SC',serif;font-size:31rpx;font-weight:700}.textarea{min-height:420rpx;margin-top:16rpx;padding:22rpx;font-size:23rpx;line-height:38rpx}.publish-row{margin-top:22rpx;padding:20rpx;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;border-radius:22rpx;background:#e4ecdf;color:#163a2b;font-size:22rpx}.primary{height:86rpx;margin-top:24rpx;border-radius:22rpx;color:#fff;background:#163a2b;font-size:24rpx;font-weight:700}.primary:after{border:none}</style>
